<td>
<p><span style="font-size: 18pt;"><img class="" src="{{f:66290932}}" alt="Graduates" width="1024" height="683" /></span></p>
<p><span style="font-size: 18pt;">Welcome!</span></p>
<p>The Instruction Office at Lake Tahoe Community College is dedicated to advancing academic excellence, innovation, and student success. We proudly support the diverse educational goals of our students, faculty, staff, and surrounding community by providing exceptional leadership, communication, and coordination of the college's academic programs.&nbsp;</p>
<p>LTCC offers a wide range of high-quality degree and certificate programs designed to prepare students for today's dynamic workforce, successful transfer to four-year universities, or personal enrichment through lifelong learning. Whether you are exploring a new career, planning your transfer path, or seeking to develop new skills, LTCC has a program to meet your needs.&nbsp;</p>
<p>Explore the links below to discover the educational opportunities waiitng for you at Lake Tahoe Community College.</p>
</td>
<td>
<table class="ou-form-block"><caption>Form Section</caption>
<tbody>
<tr>
<th>Textual Content</th>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>
<h3>Have a question?</h3>
<p>We&rsquo;re just a call or email away:<br /><a href="mailto:enrollmentservices@ltcc.edu">enrollmentservices@ltcc.edu</a><span>&nbsp;</span><br /><a href="tel:1-530-541-4660">(530) 541-4660</a><span>&nbsp;</span>x 211</p>
</td>
</tr>
